sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant API as Express API
  participant Session as Browser session
  participant Page as Playwright page
  participant X as x.com
  participant DB as SQLite

  API->>Session: getBrowserContext()
  Session-->>API: Persistent Chromium context
  API->>Page: newPage()
  Page->>X: goto(tweetUrl)
  Page->>Page: Find tweet article
  Page->>Page: Find compose box or reply button
  Page->>Page: Type reply with human-like delays
  Page->>Page: Wait for enabled submit button
  Page->>X: Click submit
  Page->>Page: Check error toast
  Page-->>API: Posted successfully
  API->>DB: status = POSTED
